<title>BRAZIL: Bradesco sells assets in auto part firm.</title>
<headline>Bradesco sells assets in auto part firm.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian private bank Bradesco said it has agreed to sell assets of local auto part maker  Brosolu to U.S. Echlin Inc.'s Brazil unit.</p>
<p>The deal, which is expected to be completed in April, was signed on Thursday, the bank said.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
